# Each network failure the simulator can stage, then a retry that works and
# a fetch that survives a trip to the background. Uses example.com live.
wait-for Sample pages
scenario offline
tap-id link-3
wait-for No Wi-Fi
shot failure-offline
scenario normal
tap-id retry
wait-for Example Domain
shot failure-offline-retried
tap-id back
wait-for Sample pages
scenario host-down
tap-id link-3
wait-for The site did not answer
shot failure-host-down
tap-id return
wait-for Sample pages
scenario network-timeout
tap-id link-3
wait-for The site took too long
shot failure-timeout
tap-id return
wait-for Sample pages
scenario permission-denied
tap-id link-3
wait-for Browse cannot use the network
expect-missing Try again
shot failure-denied
tap-id return
wait-for Sample pages
scenario normal
tap-id link-3
lifecycle background
lifecycle foreground
wait-for Example Domain
shot failure-background-during-fetch
